                                        <div>
                                            <h4 class="text-sm font-extrabold text-emerald-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                                                <i class="fas fa-circle-check text-emerald-500"></i> Mastered Questions
                                                (High Competency in Class)
                                            </h4>
