                    will be included in student arcade sessions.
                </p>
                <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl text-xs space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="text-slate-400 font-medium">Station &amp; Level:</span>
                        <span class="font-extrabold text-slate-800" id="authorConfirmStation"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-slate-400 font-medium">Challenge Prompt:</span>
                        <div class="font-semibold text-slate-700 mt-0.5 line-clamp-2 break-words"
                            id="authorConfirmPrompt"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="text-slate-400 font-medium">Interactive Steps:</span>
                        <span class="font-bold text-cyan-700" id="authorConfirmSteps"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="text-slate-400 font-medium">Compiled Solution:</span>
                        <span class="font-mono font-bold text-emerald-600" id="authorConfirmAnswer"></span>
                    </div>
